  "title": "YNAB: List Transactions"
 },
 "description": "List transactions for a budget with optional filtering and pagination.\n\nArgs:\n  - budget_id (string, optional): Budget UUID. Omit to use the default budget.\n  - account_id (string, optional): Filter by account.\n  - category_id (string, optional): Filter by category.\n  - since_date (string, optional): ISO date (YYYY-MM-DD) to filter transactions on or after.\n  - type (string, optional): \"uncategorized\" or \"unapproved\".\n  - cleared (string, optional): \"cleared\", \"uncleared\", or \"reconciled\".\n  - limit (int, optional): Max results per page. Default: 50.\n  - offset (int, optional): Zero-based offset for pagination. Default: 0.\n  - response_format (string, optional): \"json\" or \"markdown\" (default: \"markdown\").\n\nReturns: transactions[], total_count, returned_count, offset, has_more, next_offset, cached, cache_info\n\nExamples:\n  - All transactions: call with no args (uses default budget)\n  - Filter by account: set account_id\n  - Last 30 days: set since_date to 30 days ago\n  - Page 2: set limit=50, offset=50\n\nErrors:\n  - \"No default budget set\" \u2192 run ynab_set_default_budget first\n  - Large result \u2192 use ynab_export_transactions to save to file",
 "inputSchema": {
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "properties": {
   "account_id": {
    "type": "string"
   },
   "budget_id": {
    "minLength": 1,
    "type": "string"
   },
   "category_id": {
    "type": "string"
   },
   "cleared": {
    "enum": [
     "cleared",
     "uncleared",
     "reconciled"
    ],
    "type": "string"
   },
   "limit": {
    "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
    "maximum": 9007199254740991,
    "type": "integer"
   },
   "offset": {
    "maximum": 9007199254740991,
    "minimum": 0,
    "type": "integer"
   },
   "response_format": {
    "default": "markdown",
    "enum": [
     "json",
     "markdown"
    ],
    "type": "string"
   },
   "since_date": {
    "pattern": "^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}$",
    "type": "string"
   },
   "type": {
    "enum": [
     "uncategorized",
     "unapproved"
    ],
    "type": "string"
   }
  },
  "type": "object"
 },
